    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "but i don't want to rewrite anything. i'm just so tired. for ten years i've been running on nothing but pure adrenaline and ambition, and now that the race is over, i'm just... exhausted. it feels like i've reached the end of the line. like there's no point in even trying to start a new chapter because the main character is already burnt out and done. doesn't it feel weird to you that everything is just... over?",
      "source": "evaluator"
    },
